      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Mendham, New Jersey, was incorporated in 1906 after residents sought improvements like sidewalks and street lights, separating from Mendham Township.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
